menu "Pocket Live source verification"
config POCKET_LIVE_WORKER_COMPILE
    bool "Compile inactive Live worker and IDF adapter"
    default n
    depends on BSP_AUDIO_CALLBACK_RENDER
    help
        Compile-check only. The public device entry still returns NOT_SUPPORTED:
        microphone/render timeline synchronization is not implemented. Does not
        activate a UI mode, listener, key, connection, or hardware operation.
        Compiles TCP transport logging out to avoid upstream credential logs.
endmenu

menu "Pocket paired Live source verification"
config POCKET_LIVE_PAIRED_COMPILE
    bool "Compile inactive paired-reference Live v2 source"
    default n
    depends on BSP_AUDIO_CALLBACK_RENDER
    select POCKET_LIVE_WORKER_COMPILE
    select LWIP_SO_LINGER
    help
        Source/build verification only. Includes paired ES8311-reference worker
        and deadline-aware network prototype. Public entry still refuses until
        physical acceptance; no UI activation or credential discovery. Enables
        SDK SO_LINGER support in this experimental build for owner-only cleanup.
endmenu

menu "Pocket offline audio diagnostic"
config POCKET_OFFLINE_DIAGNOSTIC
    bool "Enable manually armed silent paired-audio diagnostic"
    default n
    depends on BSP_AUDIO_CALLBACK_RENDER
    help
        Adds a one-attempt-per-boot silent diagnostic to the normal Diagnostics
        page. Hold OK to arm, then release and press OK again within ten seconds.
        Uses the existing voice owner, with no tone, provider, network, recording
        export or credential action. Any physical button press cancels an active
        run. Counts and signal statistics are observations, not acoustic proof.
        Ordinary startup and the default build remain unchanged.
endmenu

menu "Pocket inactive Live normal-app caller"
config POCKET_LIVE_APP_CALLER
    bool "Compile normal-app Live-only Chat caller (device admission refused)"
    default n
    depends on POCKET_LIVE_PAIRED_COMPILE
    help
        Opt-in source/build verification only. Replaces Chat hold-to-talk with
        the Live session caller and Live-only presentation. The separate source
        readiness gate remains hard false: this option does not validate hardware
        or permit any Live credentials, audio, or connection. No legacy voice
        fallback in this mode. Ordinary builds keep existing voice and controls.
endmenu

menu "Pocket local qualification (no production Live admission)"
config POCKET_QUALIFICATION
    bool "Compile bounded local qualification in normal Diagnostics"
    default n
    depends on POCKET_LIVE_PAIRED_COMPILE
    depends on !POCKET_OFFLINE_DIAGNOSTIC
    depends on ESP_CONSOLE_USB_SERIAL_JTAG && ESP_CONSOLE_SECONDARY_NONE
    help
        Test instrumentation only; the production Live gate remains hard false.
        A separately approved host request plus fresh physical confirmation is
        required. Owns one persistent USB Serial/JTAG driver for this boot and
        preserves normal UI/standby controls. Never selects UART0. No provider
        call, saved-key lookup or settings write belongs to this test path.
        Silent capture and explicitly selected capped audio are distinct; cloud
        compilation grants no permission to install, capture, export or play.
endmenu
